          <div style="font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3px;">Review Timeline</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.88rem;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;">7–15 Working Days</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;">
          <div style="font-size:0.68rem;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3px;">Support</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.82rem;font-weight:500;color:#2563eb;">info@scripthive.org</div>
